                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last year, the U.S. Surgeon General declared loneliness a national epidemic \u2013 a policy area that I\u2019ve been working in recently. Today, I held a roundtable to hear from local medical professionals and other officials to discuss loneliness, isolation, and ways we can work together to combat this epidemic.",
