                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Time and again, Director @chopracfpb has wielded power he doesn\u2019t have, and this time is no different. His attempt to exempt medical debt from credit checks is bad news for both consumers and financial institutions.",
